WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.850
Give it your all.

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.660
Right!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.480
Give it your all.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.180
Right!

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:08.940
Fight hard.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.640
Right!

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.340
Fight hard.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.040
Yah!

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:11.860
Fight hard.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:12.560
Right!

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.660
Give it your all, and have fun!

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.110
Right!

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.510
Good synchronization.

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:11.240
Good height on the jumps.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.800
Their formation changes are nice and snappy.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:09.710
<b>Soshukan Private High School</b>

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.520
<b>51st Tohoku High School Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament</b>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.520
<b>Soshukan Private High School</b>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.520
<b>Score</b>

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.070
<i><b>Hakumei University Private High School</b></i>

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:17.070
<i><b>Soshukan Private High School</b></i>

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.160
Second place!

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:20.770
Yeah!

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:22.100
Weren't they amazing?

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:22.870
Yeah!

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.050
They took second, Mom! Dad!

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:25.940
Isn't that great?

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.390
Hang on. There are still five teams left.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.130
It's not a sure thing yet.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.190
You did great! Just great!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:32.890
Yah!

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:33.660
Well done.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:34.760
That was a great performance!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:35.430
Thank you, sir!

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:36.520
Well done.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.810
Shotaro?

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.850
Shotaro!

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:49.810
You okay?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.020
We're just second place again...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.620
Is now really the time?!

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:56.660
Get him to the hospital.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.030
The taxi's already here.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.410
I'll take him.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.390
Let's go.

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.510
Sure.

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.630
Look after him.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:34.960
<b><i>Backflip!!</i></b>

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.640
I can't apologize enough.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.810
What?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.600
Futaba-kun's at the hospital?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.210
Yes. Apparently he performed
 despite being injured.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:05:00.270
It certainly didn't look that way to me.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:14.610
I'm sure Shotaro insisted on going out there.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.320
I talked to him when he was 
deciding on a high school.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:22.320
I told him that he should go
 where he really wants to go

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.810
and do what he wants to do.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.760
And it seems like he's found it.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.080
Something he can devote himself to
with all his heart.

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.990
I guess all the performances
 are over by now, huh?

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.780
I wonder how we placed.

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:53.390
Calm down. They'll call us when they know.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.700
I know, but...

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:58.310
Futaba? Shotaro Futaba?

00:05:58.310 --> 00:05:59.340
Here.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.950
Thank you for all your support!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.920
Please take care of Shotaro.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.750
You were all so awesome!

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.720
Keep up the good work! 
We're rooting for you.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:12.800
Yes!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:12.800
Yah!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.400
How's Futaba doing?

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.770
We're not sure yet.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.890
You aren't angry?

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.270
I let an injured student compete.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.880
I couldn't stop him.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:38.310
You were trying to do what 
was best for Futaba, right?

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.520
So it's not my place to argue.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.860
Futaba's your student.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.580
I wonder if it really was for the best...

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:49.750
No one ever knows for sure.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:50.460
But—

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:54.830
Still, it's not you or I who gets
 to decide what's best.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.720
It's the athlete.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.990
You know that better than anyone, I'm sure.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:07.730
Teaching really is complicated, isn't it?

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:09.720
You finally get it!

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.640
You've grown up a bit.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.760
I certainly hope so...

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.990
It's a real relief.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.170
Thank you for your help!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.070
Take care!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.810
Never do something like that again.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:34.350
Y-You're right. I'm sorry.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.690
Excuse me.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.860
Shotaro?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.570
We're at the hospital

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.570
They're seeing him now

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.570
How's Shotaro doing?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.570
Text me the minute they're done

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.570
They think he'll be fine

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.160
Thank you very much.

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.590
Thanks for holding my bag, Misato-kun.

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:56.370
No problem.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:01.210
M-Misato-kun?

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.780
You expect me to...

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.240
For the love of...

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:05.280
What's wrong?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.690
Did you hear from the team?!

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.560
How'd we place?

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.360
No! It wasn't the team!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.550
I swear!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.650
I don't know how we placed! How could I?!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.970
Oh, okay...

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:20.770
A-Anyway, let's get back to the arena!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.770
Sure.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:30.400
Why haven't they called?

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.390
Do you know, Misato-kun?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.890
I guess it's just the chaos
 of the aftermath...

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.250
You think?

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.930
Wait, did we place so badly
that they don't even want to tell us?

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.620
Maybe I'll call them myself!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.970
Desist!

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.000
"Desist"?

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:50.890
I'm sure... they're just busy.

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.770
But I probably should—

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:54.680
No!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:55.340
But...

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.090
Don't you dare call them!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.010
I forbid it!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.230
<b><i>K-Wave</i></b>

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.580
Thank you, sir.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.060
Thank you.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.400
Let's hurry, Misato-kun!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.110
Y-Yeah.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:16.110
Shotaro! Misato!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:18.250
How'd it go?

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:21.880
The doctor was pretty mad that I performed.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.740
Well? How's your wrist?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.370
It's okay. The bone's intact.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.880
But I won't be able to practice for a while.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.870
I see...

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:31.860
That's a relief.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.630
Talk about a load off!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.840
But what about regionals?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.710
How'd we place?

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:47.850
Did... Did another team overtake us?

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:56.430
Is this it? Is it all over?

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:01.750
No... That can't be...

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.320
Bah-bah-da-dah!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.920
Certificate of Merit

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.920
Chill out. We got second, man. Second!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:16.010
None of the subsequent teams 
placed above us.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.690
The Tohoku representatives at the Inter-High

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.800
will be first-place Shiro High 
and second-place Ao High! Us!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:26.420
Boy, the Iwate team 
put on a great show after us.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.320
I was shakin' in my booties.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:31.100
They almost had us. 
Just a tenth of a point below!

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.190
Riding the knife's edge!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:36.570
Then Misato texted to let us 
know your wrist was okay...

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.750
I wanted to tell him how we did, 
but Onagawa-senpai insisted that we wait.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.120
A man's gotta have his big moments, right?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.920
I didn't want any part of this!

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:45.950
I'm sorry.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.420
Er, sorry. Are you mad?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.320
I told you not to mess with him.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.130
You were all for it, Captain!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.530
You bought the poppers, too.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.250
Well, once we'd committed, 
we had to do it right!

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.380
You really were all for it.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.760
Shotaro?

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.020
I'm so glad...

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:10.880
I'm so glad!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:17.280
I... I was so worried... that you couldn't 
go to the Inter-High because of me.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:24.080
If that had happened... 
I'd never... ever...

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:28.660
Shotaro...

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:39.920
We'll soar together again,
 thanks to you!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.630
Captain...

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.410
Futaba-kun!

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:59.190
How's your wrist?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.800
It's looking good!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.260
Then let's get going.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:11.200
Right!

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:11.200
Yah!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.480
We're celebrating advancing 
to the Inter-High.

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:14.940
My treat.

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:16.450
For real?!

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:16.450
Such a generous coach!

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.880
Thank you!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:24.630
<b>Kawamura</b>

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.440
There you go! Eight menchi-katsu!

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.440
<b>Menchi-katsu</b>

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.440
Spring Rolls

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.440
<b><i>Creamy Crab Croquettes</i></b>

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.440
<b>Corn Croquettes</b>

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:29.060
Thanks as always!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:29.930
Yah!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.600
Here you are.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.460
<b>Good luck,Miyagi</b>

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.460
Business Hours

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.460
Takoyaki

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.430
Thanks!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.200
You must be proud, 
gettin' them to the Inter-High.

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:37.950
They got themselves there.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.820
You'd better take the big prize!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:45.740
<b>TSURUYA</b>

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:45.740
<b>T
A
K
O
Y
A
K
I</b>

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.120
Here you are.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.780
I got the menchi-katsu!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.440
Hey, thanks!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.530
That's the stuff!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.230
It fills you head to toe!

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.540
You said it!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:56.350
Misato-kun, do you have 
Mashiro Tsukiyuki's contact information?

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.960
Y-Yes.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.880
You should call him, then.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.620
He seemed worried about Shotaro.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:08.550
You'd better bring it even 
harder at the Inter-High.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.930
Not that we'll be yielding 
the top spot, of course.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.540
We'll be praying for Shotaro's recovery,

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.990
so that Ao High can fight 
at 100 percent strength.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:18.120
Takase...

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.390
Mutsu-kun...

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.610
Misa-pon's always great.

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:27.810
But Shotaro was also great today.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:31.240
My mind went blank watching him.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:35.540
"I won't let you beat me, so we'd
 better meet again at the Inter-High."

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.760
Tell him that.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:41.090
Mashiro said that?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.800
So, what's the story on your wrist?

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.380
When can you get back to practice?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.640
Actually...

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:52.550
I'm supposed to stay off it 
for a month instead of two weeks now.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:53.750
A whole month?!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.140
That's right up to the Inter-High...

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:59.480
So you can't practice at all?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.150
I'll do the best I can!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.060
That's right. Just do the best you can.

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:06.690
No practice using that hand for a while.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:10.160
How are we gonna compete 
at the Inter-High like that?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.060
Remember, we got lucky today.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:17.660
It was just as likely that he'd 
never be able to perform again.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.670
I can't let you be that reckless again.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.270
That's fair.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:28.880
If Shotaro's injury had gotten worse, 
we could've been in real trouble.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.380
The coach's judgment would 
have been called into question.

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:36.310
The club itself could have been suspended.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:40.560
If it had come to that, were you planning 
to take responsibility all on your own?

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:48.490
I told you. Nobody can take responsibility.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:51.150
I'd just be taking the punishment.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:53.420
Coach...

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:58.480
I won't do any exercises 
using this hand for a month!

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:01.260
And I'll get better as soon as I can!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:02.940
I'm counting on it.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.420
Is that how committed you were?

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:11.590
It's nothing as grand as that.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:15.080
When I was younger, I competed with an injury

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.490
and it put an end to my career as a gymnast.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:20.700
But I don't regret it.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:24.540
I did what I believed in, 
without regard for the future.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:28.360
It was the only choice I could have made.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.780
It took time to realize that, though.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.130
The future is important, to be sure.

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:37.440
You shouldn't do anything 
to compromise yours.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:39.610
And sometimes you need 
to reevaluate your course

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.120
to make sure you're heading 
in the right direction.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.690
But I don't think it's correct 
to worry about the future

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.250
at the expense of how you feel right now.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:54.520
Even if it's the "right" future.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.770
I wanted you to choose.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.910
If you start to move down the wrong path,

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:06.070
I'll do anything I can to help you.

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.670
No matter how many times it takes.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.500
But as an educator, maybe 
I really should have stopped you.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.910
I don't think I'm really cut out for teaching.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.600
That's not true!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.470
Your decision to allow Shotaro to compete

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.240
is what earned the six of us
 the chance to soar together again!

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:29.840
Meeting you, Shida-san... Coach... 
is what's brought us this far!

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.440
Thank you!

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:35.840
Thank you!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:46.490
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:50.360
You kept your promise 
to take me to the Inter-High.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.660
And when I watched you compete,

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.240
I felt like I was flying again myself.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.520
I felt like I was soaring with you.

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:05.670
You let me soar once more.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.630
I was so happy.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.290
Thank you.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.870
Let me say it, too!

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.690
Tsukidate, Onagawa, Watari, 
Shotaro, Misato, Kurikoma!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.130
Thank you all!

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.390
Likewise, Captain.

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:32.170
I'm so glad I came to Ao High 
and discovered men's rhythmic gymnastics!

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.920
Don't sweat it! You heard the Captain.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.610
You're the one who got us to the Inter-High.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:41.290
That's enough, right?

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:44.010
Wha? Who said that again?

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.580
Remember our score?

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:50.340
It was 17.800!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.340
I screwed up my Barani flip.

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:57.350
And my round off backflip 
layout full twist...

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:59.800
Sorry! My tuck full twist...

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.930
My handstand was kinda loose.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.800
My aerial could've been neater in the lift.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.350
Yeah, me too.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.150
We've got greater heights to rise to.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:12.270
We're gonna put on 
a 100 percent perfect performance,

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.480
and next time, we're gonna win!

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.830
Maybe Shotaro can't practice for a month,

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.820
but it ain't any fun to concede
 failure out of the gate!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.820
Right!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:25.250
I agree. Next time, we'll beat Shiro High!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.890
That's our captain.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.570
I'm ready for this!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.670
Let's take that top spot!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:34.750
This is optimism bordering on stupidity...

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:36.590
But I like it!

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:40.590
I got us plenty of data today.

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.210
That's our manager!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.410
Let's get started!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.190
Let's soar our butts off 
until Inter-High time!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:03.870
What's wrong?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.230
The minute we got here, 
all my tension was gone.

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:14.160
It's like... this is where I really belong.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.380
Where <i>we</i> belong.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:23.240
Let's soar again tomorrow!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.280
Yeah.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.520
Wait a minute.

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.860
Shotaro... you can't soar.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.240
What? What's wrong?!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.110
You okay, Shotaro?!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.620
Did you hurt something again?

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:40.240
I-Is it a raid?!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.570
Onagawa-senpai, you backflips 
are snappier than ever.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.580
<b>Drive\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDedication\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCourage!!</b>

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.580
Aren't they?

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.960
Captain, your toes!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.080
Crap, right!

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.660
Hey!

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:09.560
You're not movin', Shotaro!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.520
Focus! Focus!

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.640
R-Right!

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:14.170
Don't be like that.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:15.560
Endure it.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.570
Right...

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.680
That's right!

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.990
We've got the Inter-High in a month.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:23.660
By the way, I'll be the ace by then.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:27.440
You keep my seat warm in the 
meantime, Substitute Ace.

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.370
Don't call me that.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:33.330
You know what'll happen 
if you're not better for the Inter-High,

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.250
don'tcha?

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.630
We're going to soar together again.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.130
Yes!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.810
Once you're recovered, 
we'll match up at light speed!

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.880
Just do what you can until then!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:45.890
Right!

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:52.750
<i>That's right... I can still soar.</i>

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.160
<i>With Misato and the rest of the team.</i>

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:59.670
<i>Since that day, since that first backflip...</i>

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:02.360
<i>my world has become bigger and broader!</i>

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.070
<i>I found a part of myself 
I never knew existed.</i>

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.550
<i>I've found a place that really matters to me.</i>

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.250
<i>I've met people who mean the world to me.</i>

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.960
<i>Because I chose for myself... 
I decided for myself...</i>

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.530
<i>What I want to do, where I want to go...</i>

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:21.240
<i>Now and forever...</i>

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:24.280
I want to soar with you!
